# The turtle threshold family's tight point (turtle 70, riposte 1): the
# same one-shot read at sample 1,500 as evolve1-g4m2-turtle85r, latching
# only at or below 70 percent of the strongest rival's worth -- the
# matches the certified corpus reads as clearly lost at the window
# (worth/rival AUC 0.79 for loss there, very-hard-race) -- with the
# riposte counter-punch behind the hold. Priced beside turtle100r so the
# threshold's shape is read on one bar rather than assumed from the 85
# point turtlebar192 prices. Every other knob and every goals slot is
# the champion's exactly.
